{
  "id": "2SA.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 19",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamuboolela Yoabu bari Lola, omuruchi alilanga, namwikhuula Abisalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokhuhula khwabwe inyanga eyo khwakwa okhwikhuula khubandu bosi; okhuba abandu bahulila nikaboolwa inyanga eyo mbu Omuruchi ubeeleele khulwa omwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaseeri nibeenjila mwitookho masilisi inyanga eyo, shinga abandu abafwimbwa emirwe olwa barulanga masilisi nibeelukha lihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi naye niyeefuunikha mumoni, khandi omuruchi yalakaya nende omwoyo omukhongo, ari O, mwana wanje Abisalomu, O Abisalomu, mwana wanje, mwana wanje! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoabu niyeenjila munzu ewa omuruchi yali, nasunga mbu Leelo luno ofwimbiye abasumbabo bosi omurwe, abo abahoniye obulamubwo inyanga yino, nende obulamu bwabaanabo abasiani nende abakhaana, nende obulamu bwabakhasibo nende obulamu bwabasuriabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shichila oheelanga abo abakhukiya iwe, nobakiya abakhuheela. Okhuba orumbuule ebulafu inyanga yino mbu abakhulundu nende abasumba nibutswa khwiwe; shichila inyanga yino enduutsi mbu Abisalomu naba niyakhamenyile, ne ifwe fwesi nikhwakhafwile inyanga yino, ako kakhakhuchamisiye bulayi bwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano buukha, orule, osunjile abasumbabo akokhubalemia emioyo; shichila ekhwitsubila muMWAMI, mbu noba norarula ta, shiolatong'a noli nende omundu kata mulala eshilo shino tawe; ne ako kalaba amabii khwiwe okhushila amabii kosi akakhukwila okhurula khubwanabwo okhuula bulaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omuruchi yarula, niyeekhala muluyia. Nibaboolela abandu bosi bari Lole, omuruchi wikhaale muluyia; abandu bosi nibeetsa imbeli womuruchi. Habula Isiraeli bali nibeeluushe buli mundu ebunangowe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yakalukha eYerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu bosi bali nibayingananga mumbia tsiosi tsiaIsiraeli, bari Omuruchi yakhuhonia mumukhono kwabasuku beefwe, khandi yakhuhonia mumukhono kwabaFilisiti; ne bulaano yeeluushe Abisalomu, narula mushibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Abisalomu, owa khwatsushiilila amafura nikhumwemekha, wafwiliile mwihe. Kho bulaano nishiina eshichila nimurasunga likhuwa liosi eliokhuchelesia omuruchi ta?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi Daudi yakhupila Zadoki nende Abiatsari, abakuhani, omunwa, nasunga mbu Musunjile abakofu baYuda muri Mbushiina inywe nimuhelelesia mubosi okhuchelesia omuruchi munzuye? Okhuba okhuboola khwaIsiraeli yosi khuulile ewomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe muli abaana beefwe, ninywe likumba elala ninasi khandi omubili mulala ninasi; kho bulaano mbushiina nimuhelelesia mubosi okhuchelesla omuruchi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi musunjile Amasa muri Iwe shioli likumba elala ninasi, khandi omuhili mulala ninasi? Nyasaye yakholele siesi ario, nende okhushilaho, noba noraba omuseesia welihe imbeli wanje obushia nobushia mushilenje shiaYoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yabeenamia emioyo abaYuda bosi, shinga omwoyo kwomundu mulala; okhuula olwa bakhupila omuruchi omunwa, bari Okalushe, halala nende abasumbabo bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindio omuruchi yachelela, niyoola khuYorodani; abaYuda bosi niboola eGiligali, okhwitsa okhubukaanila omuruchi, okhwambusia omuruchi muYorodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Shimei waGera, omuBenyamini, owali weBahurimu, yaanguha niyeetsa halala nende abaYuda okhubukaanila omuruchi Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne baliho abaBenyamini eshikhumila halala ninaye; nende Ziba omwenoyo omusumba weinzu yaSaulo, nende abaanabe ekhumi nabaraano nabasumbabe amakhumi kabili bosi; nibabira muYorodani omuruchi naliho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bali nibaambukhanga munyambukho okhwambusia abomunzu yomuruchi, nende okhukhola kosi aka yeenya. Naye Shimei waGera niyeekhupa hasi imbeli womuruchi olwa yali nali okhwambukha Yorodani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namusunjila omuruchi ari Omwami wanje aleshe okhumbasiliakhwo obumayaanu, kata oreetsulilakhwo akoburambatsanu aka omusumbawo yakhola khunyanga eya omwami wanje omuruchi yarulila eYerusalemu tawe; omuruchi aleshe okhukeetsulila mumwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba isie omusumbawo emanyile mbu ndoonoona; khulwako, lola, inyanga yino nisie ouranjiliile munzu yosi yaYusufu okhukholomokha nimbukaanila omwami wanje omuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Abishai waZeruya nakalusiamwo nasunga mbu Shimei shiyeetsa okhwirwa khulwa likhuwa lino, mbu yamuseya masihi wOMWAMI? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi naboola mbu Nasi endi nelikhuwa shiina nineenyu, inywe abaana baZeruya, kho nimuba abamayinje khwisie inyanga yino? Omundu yesi yeetsa okhwirwa inyanga yino muIsiraeli noho? Nasi shimanyile mbu leelo luno endi omuruchi waIsiraeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi namusunjila Shimei ari Shiwitsa okhufwa tawe. Khandi omuruchi namwitsubila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mefiboshetsi omwitsukhulu waSaulo nakholomokha okhumubukaanila omuruchi; ne shiyali nakasiye ebilenjebie, kata okhubeka eshilefu, kata okhwosia tsingubotsie ta, okhurula khunyanga eya omuruchi yarulila okhuula khunyanga eya yachelela hango nomulembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali narulile eYerusalemu okhubukaanila omuruchi, omuruchi yamureeba mbu Nishiina eshiachila norarula ninasi ta, Mefiboshetsi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nakalusia mbu Omwami wanje omuruchi, omusumba wanje yangaatia; okhuba isie omusumbawo ndasunga mbu Ndaleeyalila isishili, eniinekhwo, enzie nende omuruchi; okhuba omusumbawo nomulema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ye yanjiikha isie omusumbawo ewomwami wanje omuruchi; nebutswa omwarmi wanje omuruchi ali shinga malaika waNyasaye; kho okhole aka oluutsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba abeinzu yapapa khwali butswa abafu imbeli womwami wanje omuruchi; ne khane wara omusumbawo hakari wa abo abali nibaliitsanga khumeesayo. Kho bulaano eshili nende likhuwa shi eliakhachila nimuupila omuruchi tsimbungu khandi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi namusunjila ari Mbushiina noshiboolanga khumakhuwako? Isie esunga mbu Iwe nende Ziba mukabane liloba elo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefiboshetsi nasunjila omuruchi ari Mbula, abukule liosi, olwa omuruchi yeenjiile munzu yiye omwene nomulembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Barizilai omuGileadi yakholomokha narula eRogelimu; niyoola khuYorodani halala nende omuruchi, mbu amwambusie muYorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Barizilai oyo yali omukofu muno, owemiyika amakhumi munazne; ne yali niya; nuliisinjia omuruchi olwa yali namenyanga eMahanaimu; okhuba yali omundu omukhongo muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi namusunjila Barizilai ari Wambushe ninasi, nasi ndalakhuliisinjia ewanje eYerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barizilai namusunjila omuruchi ari Nasi eshili nemiyika chinga, mbu endikulushe halala nende omuruchi enzie eYerusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie leelo endi owemiyika amakhumi munaane; enyala okhwahukhasia amalayi nende amabii noho? Isie omusumbawo enyala okhuhulila eshiuya shiebindu ebia endiitsanga kata ebia enyweetsanga? Eshinyala okhuhulila emioyo chiabasaatsa abeembi kata abakhasi abeembi noho? Iiho nishiina eshiakhachila omusumbawo abe nashikhusitohelanga ario, omwami wanje omuruchi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusumbawo yeenya butswa okhwambukha Yorodani halala nende omuruchi, khwonyene; kho nishiina eshiakhachila omuruchi yarunje amatani akahela kario? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chama isie omusumbawo engalushe, efwile mwitaala lianje omwene, heshilindwa shiapapa nende eshiamama. Habula lola, omusumbawo Khimuhamu ngwowuno; lekha yaambushe halala nende omwami wanje omuruchi; nomukholela aka oluutsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi nakalusia mbu Khimuhamu ndalaambukha ninaye, khandi ndalamukholela aka oba nololanga; khandi liosi liosi elia wakheenye khwisie, ndalakhukholelanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abandu bosi nibaambukha Yorodani, omuruchi yesi niyaambukha; omuruchi namutsunzuuna Barizilai, namusabila ikhabi; naye nakalukha ewuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi niyaambukha okhuula eGiligali, naye Khimuhamu niyaambukha nulaye halala; abandu bosi baYuda nibamwambusia omuruchi, khandi nende inusu yabaIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, abandu bosi baIsiraeli nibamutsiila omuruchi, nibamureeba omuruchi bari Nishiina eshichilile abandu baYuda nibakhwiba, nibaambusia omuruchi, nende abeinzuye bosi, muYorodani, nende abandu bosi baDaudi halala ninaye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu bosi baYuda nibakalusia abaIsiraeli bari Shichila omuruchi nomuluyia weefwe; kho mbushiina nimusinyishila likhuwa lino? Ifwe khwaliile eshindu shiosi shiomuruchi noho? Kata yakhuheelekhvio eshihaanwa shiosi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu baIsiraeli nibakalusia sbaYuda, nibasunga mbu Ifwe khuli nende ebitonye likhumi mumuruchi; ne kata muDaudi khu nushila; kho nishiina eshiachila nimukhufwola? Shikhubeele ifwe abaranjilila okhuboola akokhuchelesia omuruchi? Amakhuwa kabandu baYuda nikaba amalulu okhushila amakhuwa kabandu baIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
